  "boundary": "This release VSA EVIDENCES that the NOUS release operator verified, with standard Sigstore tooling, that these exact published wheel and sdist bytes carry a SLSA build provenance (keyless GitHub Actions, Fulcio/Rekor) and a PEP 740 PyPI publish attestation, both naming these bytes, at SLSA Build Level 2. It is an operator-key root ALONGSIDE the federation roots; it is not a second build. The offline verifier checks the operator signature and re-derives the subject digests, but does NOT re-derive the named federation attestations (toolchain tier: fetch + Sigstore). It PROVES nothing (no Z3/Farkas leg). NOUS is a monitor, not a guard.",
